# Minimal build context (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore, T033): only the
# inputs the image build actually consumes. A small context is faster and,
# more importantly, part of the reproducibility contract — nothing outside
# this list can silently change the build inputs.
**
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
!src/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!deploy/ci/image/build-constraints.txt
